flowchart TB
    UI[Profile network settings UI] --> PM[ProfileManager]
    PM --> Config[ProfileNetworkConfig]
    Config --> NM[NetworkManager]
    NM --> Adapter[ChromiumNetworkAdapter]
    Adapter --> Chromium[Chromium network implementation]
    NM --> Monitor[NetworkMonitor]
    NM --> Tester[ConnectionTester]
    NM --> Secure[SecureCredentialStore]
    Monitor --> Status[Connection status]
    Tester --> Result[Test result]
    Secure --> Keystore[Android Keystore-backed storage]

